## Family and query semantics

Parent P contains opening, slot, transition, mapping and observation constraints.
Named view i supplies A_i only. A parent query uses P; a single-view query uses
P AND A_i. Multiple views require explicit intersection or union. Views may
overlap or fail to cover P; labels supply neither exclusivity nor probabilities.
Actual finite choices enumerate all declared values jointly. Boolean predicates
are split by an exhaustive truth-assignment partition of their atomic comparisons;
each cell includes the formula and its decision prefix. The partition is disjoint
by construction. Integer variables are enumerated only with finite declared bounds.
Each candidate assignment/predicate cell is counted once, including infeasible
cells. Views do not add cells unless their explicit Boolean predicate requires a
logical partition. Continuous regions remain symbolic. Unvisited suffixes are
represented by ordinal range and the unchanged family formula.

Slots instantiate nonnegative amounts and an active flag; inactive means zero.
Active zero is permitted. Both signed posting incidence and economic-state
coefficients are declared by the template. Exact context equality is required
for observations. One observation ID cannot silently supply incompatible domains.
Unmatched obligations remain unresolved. Admission records keep six uncertainty
categories separate. Stress is conditional, not observed evidence or a likelihood.

## Numerical semantics

Feasibility is checked on each original strict cell before closure optimisation.
A nonempty convex linear cell has the same infimum/supremum as its closure: for
any original feasible point x and any closure point y, (1-t)y+t x satisfies every
strict inequality for 0<t<=1 and tends to y. The solver therefore optimises closed
inequalities, proves no better closed value, then tests equality with the endpoint
under original constraints. Empty strict cells never acquire relaxation witnesses.
Unknown in any proof or endpoint test leaves the bound uncertified. Unbounded,
Unknown, Infeasible and PartialSearch remain distinct. Partial-cell extrema are
explored-only, never global certificates.

Debt amounts F,V satisfy F>=0, V>=0, F+V=D. For exact D>0, alpha=F/D is equivalent
to the fraction parameterisation. With rounded D, use amounts directly. A fixed
fraction comparison F/D op a may multiply by D only after proving D>0 (or reverse
the comparison after proving D<0). Unknown sign or an unknown threshold is
unsupported. Unknown-by-unknown products and unbounded integer domains are also
unsupported; they never imply infeasibility.

Disclosure intervals retain inclusion flags. Half-even display domains include
both ties for an even displayed minor-unit integer and neither for an odd one.
Posting quantisation rounds exact rationals at the declared boundary. Symbolic
posting amounts use bounded integers; continuous relaxation is forbidden.

Finite measures use unique joint atom IDs with weights summing to one. Conditional
views are events on atoms. Likelihood information blocks can be used once. Default
and unresolved mass are retained; unavailable outcomes prevent an unconditional
mean. Grouping requires matching rate/reset/maturity/hedge keys and additive
transition/report checks for the explicit scenario and horizon; contract memory
is retained. These tests do not prove general aggregation equivalence.

## Execution

Use existing Python/Z3, standard library and accepted P03 dependencies; install
nothing. Run `python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_accounting_p04.py' -v`
and the analogous P03 regression, followed by `python3 -B scripts/check_accounting_p04.py
--output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04 --execution-inventory
 data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/phase-entry-inventory.json`.
No accelerator framework is used; CPU-only checks intentionally hide GPU devices.
The checker records actual versions, elapsed time, hashes, generated formulas,
proof queries, observations and protection comparisons. Git is unavailable; content
hashes preserve provenance. Human acceptance remains pending.
